  "id": "marrowhouse",
  "note": "MARROW HOUSE: six storeys of offices on Marrow Street, between Solenne and Nico's (docs/proposals/marrow-midrises.md).\n\nSolenne in miniature, on purpose: a pale stone podium with a bronze canopy over the doors and the name in bronze on the stone, then Solenne's champagne glass (`ty_solenne`) between stone fins that run gold at night, a stone band, one storey set back under a bronze coping, and a plant room. Half Kestrel's height and a smaller plot, so it reads as the low building on the block.\n\n⚠ EVERY MASS IS A SQUARE, the plant room included, for the reason in Kestrel's note.\n\n⚠ THE GLASS DRAWS ITS OWN STOREYS. No window repeats on the shaft; the fins are the rhythm.",
